edge</button><button data-action=\"print\">Print</button></div></section>\n<section id=\"s002\"><h2>2. Purpose</h2><p>The purpose of this manual is to codify repeatable processes that reduce variance and improve reliability. Each section contains actionable steps, examples, and verification criteria.</p><p>Teams should treat this document as the single source of truth. Where conflicts arise between this manual and local runbooks, the manual takes precedence unless",
